===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}

* {{lb|en|Irish mythology}} The [[Connacht]] hero in the [[Ulster Cycle]] of Irish mythology who wooed [[Findabair]]/Finnabair and [[Treblann]], but was drowned in a river in a duel with [[Cúchulainn]].  His story is found in the ''Táin Bó Fraích,'' which is set before the events of the ''Táin Bó Cuailnge.''

